		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Rare Compass</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 1,234 g</p><p><em>Inscribed with runes for each of the four elements.</em></p><hr><p>Grants guidance when faced with a choice of direction or action (1/Safe Rest). Roll 1d4:</p><ul><li><strong>1 - Fire.</strong> Points towards riskiest path</li><li><strong>2 - Air.</strong> Points towards the most direct path</li><li><strong>3 - Water.</strong> Points towards the safest path</li><li><strong>4 - Earth.</strong> Points towards the most consistent path</li></ul><p><em>Activate to roll the 1d4 and post the guidance.</em></p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Khan Wick, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
